          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Guilds by bot",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "discord_guilds is published by every bot replica for its own shard slice, so this sums them per job. Slices are disjoint by shard ownership (docs/roadmap/12-horizontal-scaling.md), which is what makes the sum a fleet total rather than a double count. The series is deliberately absent, not zero, for a replica that has not identified yet."
